mpp for Ubuntu Rock 5B
----------------------

This source package uses `3.0 (quilt)`.

The `+ds` orig tarball is exported from mpp-rockchip commit 1375813c with the
upstream `debian/` directory and unused Windows binaries removed:

* tools/AStyle.exe
* tools/TextEncoding.exe

Ubuntu packaging changes live under `debian/`. Source patches are listed in
`debian/patches/series`.
